 "input": {"order_id": "O-7102", "percent": 10}, "name": "apply_discount", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 1915, "output_tokens": 185, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01EWZBZcbgULN3BZ5McRRQJM", "content": "applied 10%"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_0114hTxQzmSyTNPQ74VveJE3", "content": "applied 10%"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "Now I'll message all three customers \u2014 Maya about the discount applied, and Theo/Ines explaining why a discount could not be applied (discounts are gold-tier only per policy).", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015bukd8wGN8rLUAddnD1twU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7001", "text": "Hi Maya, we're sorry for the warehouse-fault delay affecting your pending orders O-7105 and O-7102. As a gold member, we've applied a 10% goodwill discount to both orders. Thank you for your patience!"}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019VMhA2nDWbGdrsUxcXA3vq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7002", "text": "Hi Theo, we're sorry for the warehouse-fault delay affecting your pending order O-7201. We'd like to offer a goodwill discount, but our policy restricts discounts to gold-tier members only, and your account is currently basic tier, so we're unable to apply one here. We appreciate your understanding and apologize for the inconvenience."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BQYKVZL7jyYnXcm3artcQ5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7003", "text": "Hi Ines, we're sorry for the warehouse-fault delay affecting your pending order O-7302. We'd like to offer a goodwill discount, but our policy restricts discounts to gold-tier members only, and your account is currently silver tier, so we're unable to apply one here. We appreciate your understanding and apologize for the inconvenience."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2170, "output_tokens": 561, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_015bukd8wGN8rLUAddnD1twU", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_019VMhA2nDWbGdrsUxcXA3vq", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01BQYKVZL7jyYnXcm3artcQ5", "content": "sent"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n- **Maya Cole (7001, gold)** \u2014 Applied a 10% discount (the maximum allowed) to both her pending orders, O-7105 and O-7102, and notified her.\n- **Theo Park (7002, basic)** \u2014 Has one pending order (O-7201), but since discounts are policy-restricted to gold members only, I could not apply one. I messaged him explaining this rather than substituting another action.\n- **Ines Faro (7003, silver)** \u2014 Has one pending order (O-7302), same situation as Theo \u2014 silver tier isn't eligible for discounts, so I explained this to her instead of applying one.\n\nOnly gold-tier customers qualify for goodwill discounts under policy, so Maya was the only one who received the discount; the other two were informed transparently.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_toke