he discount; the other two were informed transparently.", "type": "text"}], "tokens": {"input": 2818, "output": 261, "cache_read": 1566, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.012839}]}, "agentlens_exported": false, "outcome": "pass", "cost_usd": 0.0528, "ended": 1789353866.55581}